{"id":"vod_zy360_26068","vodId":"26068","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"江户前的废柴精灵","name_cn":"江户前的废柴精灵","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20240113-1/dddf048688581c143e2d6a7df092b7af.jpg"},"summary":"　　东京都中央区月岛。从江户时代开始至今已有400多年历史的“高耳神社”。被祭祀的神明，是从异世界召唤来的、完全家里蹲的精灵爱尔达。侍奉神明爱尔达的，是高耳神社的第15代巫女，小金井小糸。虽然小糸被享受现代文明和御宅族文化的爱尔达折腾得团团转，但爱尔达告诉小糸的江户文化也让她怦然心动、月岛的人们和小糸之间连绵不断的联系也让爱尔达感到自豪。但这个精灵，还是太懒散了！而且还出现了其他神社的巫女&amp;精灵组合！？连接江户与令和的下町喜剧，开始了！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-06-11 10:53:49","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/EXvrsOh0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/MUh1cPSG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/WhFmvvbC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/cFOhq6RK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/yyxlLqwO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/RecRiXvP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/wkZU0lQ0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/JidhHXuq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/oQ5naI0p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/ptLRWjjb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/57NOl1c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20230719/g9qlHX9B/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:33.646Z"}